OL,3,APolice officers killed in wrong-way
OL,4,Acrash mourned in 'unimaginable loss'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers killed in a
OL,7,Fwrong-way crash on the A66 near
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough have been remembered as
OL,9,F"brave officers protecting our
OL,10,Fcommunities" in what has been described
OL,11,Fas an "unimaginable loss".
OL,13,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,14,FClough, 38, were killed when a
OL,15,FVolkswagen Passat with five occupants
OL,16,Fsaid to be in their late teens to early
OL,17,F20s, driving the wrong way, struck the
OL,18,FCleveland Police vehicle at about 03:39
OL,19,FBST on Saturday.
OL,21,FThe teens, who were also killed, have
OL,22,Fnot been named.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
